WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.500
[Music, clicks and notification sounds]
A business switches between separate tools.

00:06.500 --> 00:10.000
[Whoosh and chime]
DryKraft: your business, connected.

00:10.000 --> 00:13.000
CRM: contacts, companies, custom fields, tasks and history.

00:13.000 --> 00:16.000
Sales: pipelines and clear follow-up ownership.

00:16.000 --> 00:19.000
Finance: invoices, expenses, approvals and currencies.

00:19.000 --> 00:22.000
Outreach: email, SMS, AI voice and WhatsApp.

00:22.000 --> 00:25.000
Automation: a record changes, then the next step follows.

00:25.000 --> 00:30.800
Dashboard: illustrative KPIs, charts and example totals.
